title: Hold the Traditions? 2 Thessalonians 2 and the Bible Alone
description: A lesson answering the use of 2 Thessalonians 2:15 against the Bible alone: the chapter in its context, the traditions of men in Mark 7, the Bereans who searched the scriptures in Acts 17, another gospel accursed in Galatians 1, and how to answer a proof text with the whole word of God.
output: lessons/heresies/hold-the-traditions-the-bible-alone.html
context: yes

